      "direction": "outbound",
      "type": "text",
      "status": "sent",
      "text": "Here's the quote for Meta ads management with a daily budget of ₦5,000 over one week:\n\n- Total advertising budget for 7 days: ₦35,000\n- Service fee for running and managing the ads: ₦30,000\n- Total amount: ₦65,000\n\nThis includes managing 1 video ad, monitoring, adjusting targeting, and retargeting as needed throughout the campaign.\n\nWould you like to proceed with payment and start the campaign?",
      "createdAt": "2026-10-07T09:20:01.523Z"
